  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "MediaInfo - 媒体信息",
      "name": "mediainfo_-_媒体信息",
      "desc": "<p><code>mediainfo</code> 模块用于读取媒体文件的元信息. 当前实现基于 AutoJs6 内置的 <code>scriptRuntime.mediaInfo</code> 与 <code>org.mediainfo.android.MediaInfo</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/mediainfo/Mediainfo.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/mediainfo/MediainfoNativeObject.kt</code>, <code>org/mediainfo/android/MediaInfo.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">mediainfo</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] mediainfo",
          "name": "[@]_mediainfo",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mediainfo(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "mediainfo",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>mediainfo(path)</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-read\">mediainfo.read(path)</a> 等价. 只接受一个参数.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] mediainfo"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] read",
          "name": "[m]_read",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "read(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "read",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 媒体文件路径, 不可为空</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"mediainfoNativeObjectType\">MediainfoNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读取媒体文件信息并返回脚本侧对象. <code>path</code> 会先通过运行时文件模块解析为非空路径; <code>null</code> / <code>undefined</code> 或空白字符串会抛出异常.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let info = mediainfo.read(&#39;./video.mp4&#39;);\nconsole.log(info.inform);\nconsole.log(info.video(&#39;Width&#39;));\nconsole.log(info.general(&#39;Format&#39;));\nconsole.log(info.video()); // 读取 Video 流默认文本\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">MediainfoNativeObject</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><code>MediainfoNativeObject</code> 会在构造时读取一次 MediaInfo 输出文本, 并把文本解析为可访问的对象属性. 当前对象没有显式 <code>close()</code> 方法; 底层读取由 <code>scriptRuntime.mediaInfo</code> 完成.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] read"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] path",
          "name": "[p]_path",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>运行时解析后的媒体文件路径.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] path"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] inform",
          "name": "[p]_inform",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MediaInfo 输出的原始文本. 动态属性解析也来自这段文本.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] inform"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] general",
          "name": "[m]_general",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "general(parameter?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "general",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ parameter = `\"\"` ]** { [string](dataTypes#string) } ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "parameter = `\"\"` ]** { [string](dataTypes#string) }"
                    },
                    {
